<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="556030908"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1799894983"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Neo-Aspect"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Roselia"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Anfang"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:03.316"><div begin="00:01.309" end="05:03.636"><p begin="00:01.309" end="00:04.417" itunes:key="L3942">美しき命の艶麗<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">美丽生命的娇艳之姿</span></p><p begin="00:04.427" end="00:09.066" itunes:key="L3943">紡がれた調べ 生まれゆく道<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">编织的旋律 生存之道</span></p><p begin="00:09.076" end="00:11.776" itunes:key="L3944">Believe me this is the right way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信我 这就是正确之路</span></p><p begin="00:27.922" end="00:31.046" itunes:key="L3945">灯りは何処へ消えた？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">灯光消失去了何方?</span></p><p begin="00:31.056" end="00:33.742" itunes:key="L3946">手繰り寄せるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了摸索搜寻</span></p><p begin="00:33.752" end="00:38.588" itunes:key="L3947">伸ばす手は何も掴めないまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伸出的双手什么也没能抓住</span></p><p begin="00:38.598" end="00:41.668" itunes:key="L3948">息継ぎも上手くできず<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连呼吸也并不顺利</span></p><p begin="00:41.678" end="00:48.160" itunes:key="L3949">冷えた唇 黙り込む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冰冷的唇沉默无言</span></p><p begin="00:48.170" end="00:50.672" itunes:key="L3950">Into（Darkness darkness）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉入黑暗</span></p><p begin="00:50.682" end="00:53.340" itunes:key="L3951">I feel（Loneliness loneliness）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感到寂寞</span></p><p begin="00:53.350" end="00:59.394" itunes:key="L3952">Your voice 心の裏側に触れた刹那<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的声音刹那触碰到我的心底</span></p><p begin="00:59.404" end="01:01.356" itunes:key="L3953">（Find a way find a way）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找到一条路</span></p><p begin="01:01.366" end="01:03.996" itunes:key="L3954">I know（Loved one loved one）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道谁是我所爱</span></p><p begin="01:04.006" end="01:09.367" itunes:key="L3955">もう一度繋ごう 手を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们再次紧握双手</span></p><p begin="01:09.377" end="01:12.521" itunes:key="L3956">きっと悔しくって 情けなくって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定就算不甘 就算可悲</span></p><p begin="01:12.531" end="01:15.369" itunes:key="L3957">涙したって 此処にいるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算泪流满面 我也会在这里</span></p><p begin="01:15.379" end="01:19.719" itunes:key="L3958">扉は開けておくから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会为你打开心门</span></p><p begin="01:19.729" end="01:20.704" itunes:key="L3959">I hold you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我拥抱着你</span></p><p begin="01:20.714" end="01:21.843" itunes:key="L3960">Beautiful prouder<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我美丽的骄傲</span></p><p begin="01:21.853" end="01:23.163" itunes:key="L3961">So, Beautiful braver<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此的美丽勇敢</span></p><p begin="01:23.173" end="01:24.554" itunes:key="L3962">So, Beautiful brighter<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此的美丽明媚</span></p><p begin="01:24.564" end="01:29.369" itunes:key="L3963">誇り高く（奏でたい）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多想骄傲地弹奏起来</span></p><p begin="01:29.379" end="01:31.425" itunes:key="L3964">Ah on stage<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在舞台上</span></p><p begin="01:31.435" end="01:33.303" itunes:key="L3965">Sing away! Sing away!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放声歌唱 放声歌唱</span></p><p begin="01:33.313" end="01:39.800" itunes:key="L3966">魅せよう 新たな姿を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向我展示 你崭新的姿态吧</span></p><p begin="01:37.032" end="01:39.783" itunes:key="L3967">Wo wo wow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Wo wo wow…</span></p><p begin="01:39.813" end="01:42.299" itunes:key="L13223">Wo wo wow</p><p begin="01:42.329" end="01:44.971" itunes:key="L13224">Wo wo wow</p><p begin="01:45.001" end="01:47.561" itunes:key="L13225">Wo wo wow</p><p begin="01:58.556" end="02:01.653" itunes:key="L3968">聴こえないフリをして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">装作没有听见的样子</span></p><p begin="02:01.663" end="02:04.332" itunes:key="L3969">振り向かずにいた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有回过头去</span></p><p begin="02:04.342" end="02:09.217" itunes:key="L3970">感情に潰されないようにと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了不被感情所控</span></p><p begin="02:09.227" end="02:12.300" itunes:key="L3971">知らず知らずのうちに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知不觉间逐渐被吞噬</span></p><p begin="02:12.310" end="02:18.761" itunes:key="L3972">飲まれてく意志 薄れだす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">意识开始模糊</span></p><p begin="02:18.771" end="02:21.312" itunes:key="L3974">I will（Go ahead go ahead）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会继续向前</span></p><p begin="02:21.322" end="02:24.048" itunes:key="L3975">This is（Destiny destiny）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是宿命</span></p><p begin="02:24.058" end="02:30.028" itunes:key="L3976">Your eyes 瞳の裏側に灯る世界<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世界在你眼中点亮</span></p><p begin="02:30.038" end="02:32.035" itunes:key="L3977">（Find a way find a way）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找到一条路</span></p><p begin="02:32.045" end="02:34.704" itunes:key="L3978">You know（Brightness brightness）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道何为光明</span></p><p begin="02:34.714" end="02:39.951" itunes:key="L3979">もう一度 始めよう今<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在 再次开始吧</span></p><p begin="02:39.961" end="02:43.140" itunes:key="L3980">きっと辛くたって もどかしくって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使辛苦 即使苦闷</span></p><p begin="02:43.150" end="02:46.106" itunes:key="L3981">躓いたって 傍に居るよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使受挫 我也一定会在你身边</span></p><p begin="02:46.116" end="02:50.278" itunes:key="L3982">扉は開けておくから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会为你打开心门</span></p><p begin="02:50.288" end="02:51.267" itunes:key="L3983">I got you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经抓住了你</span></p><p begin="02:51.277" end="02:53.878" itunes:key="L3984">夢に沿って 言葉に沿って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沿着梦想 沿着话语</span></p><p begin="02:53.888" end="03:00.067" itunes:key="L3985">想いに沿って 駆け上がるわ（届けたい）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沿着思念</span></p><p begin="03:00.077" end="03:02.040" itunes:key="L3986">Ah on stage<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在舞台上</span></p><p begin="03:02.050" end="03:03.981" itunes:key="L3987">Only one! Only one!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是唯一</span></p><p begin="03:03.991" end="03:10.350" itunes:key="L3988">廻ろう 貴方の気持ちと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听从你的内心 旋转吧</span></p><p begin="03:41.479" end="03:46.611" itunes:key="L3989">音粒を一つずつ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像将音乐一一拥入怀中</span></p><p begin="03:46.641" end="03:52.016" itunes:key="L21076">抱きしめるように歌うの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情歌唱</span></p><p begin="03:52.026" end="03:54.685" itunes:key="L3990">存在 Stay alive stay alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让存在永生</span></p><p begin="03:54.695" end="03:57.363" itunes:key="L3991">瞬間 Stay alive stay alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让瞬间永生</span></p><p begin="03:57.373" end="04:04.030" itunes:key="L3992">強く感じたいよ 貴方たちを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想强烈感受到你们的存在</span></p><p begin="04:04.060" end="04:07.237" itunes:key="L3993">きっと悔しくって 情けなくって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定就算不甘 就算可悲</span></p><p begin="04:07.247" end="04:10.117" itunes:key="L3994">涙したって 此処にいるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算泪流满面 我也会在这里</span></p><p begin="04:10.127" end="04:14.370" itunes:key="L3995">扉は開けておくから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会为你打开心门</span></p><p begin="04:14.380" end="04:15.263" itunes:key="L3996">I hold you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我拥抱着你</span></p><p begin="04:15.273" end="04:16.512" itunes:key="L3997">Beautiful prouder<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我美丽的骄傲</span></p><p begin="04:16.522" end="04:17.870" itunes:key="L3998">So, Beautiful braver<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此的美丽勇敢</span></p><p begin="04:17.880" end="04:19.185" itunes:key="L3999">So, Beautiful brighter<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此的美丽明媚</span></p><p begin="04:19.195" end="04:24.058" itunes:key="L4000">誇り高く（奏でたい）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多想骄傲地弹奏起来</span></p><p begin="04:24.068" end="04:25.991" itunes:key="L4001">Ah on stage<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在舞台上</span></p><p begin="04:26.001" end="04:27.930" itunes:key="L4002">Sing away! Sing away!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放声歌唱 放声歌唱</span></p><p begin="04:27.940" end="04:31.117" itunes:key="L4003">歌え！Wo wo wow</p><p begin="04:31.127" end="04:33.317" itunes:key="L4004">More! Sing away! Sing away!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续放声歌唱 放声歌唱</span></p><p begin="04:33.327" end="04:39.610" itunes:key="L4005">魅せよう 新たな姿を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向我展示 你崭新的姿态吧</span></p><p begin="04:37.102" end="04:39.590" itunes:key="L4006">Wo wo wow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Wo wo wow…</span></p><p begin="04:39.620" end="04:42.201" itunes:key="L15192">Wo wo wow</p><p begin="04:42.231" end="04:44.909" itunes:key="L15193">Wo wo wow</p><p begin="04:44.939" end="04:47.625" itunes:key="L15194">Wo wo wow</p><p begin="04:47.655" end="04:50.265" itunes:key="L25976">Wo wo wow</p><p begin="04:50.295" end="04:52.953" itunes:key="L25977">Wo wo wow</p><p begin="04:52.983" end="04:55.651" itunes:key="L25978">Wo wo wow</p><p begin="04:55.681" end="04:58.305" itunes:key="L25979">Wo wo wow</p><p begin="04:58.335" end="05:01.002" itunes:key="L25980">Wo wo wow</p><p begin="05:01.032" end="05:03.636" itunes:key="L25981">Wo wo wow</p></div></body></tt>